      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> for a <code>ConnectionFactory</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个针对 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 的 <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。",
