    {
      "source": "SPI to extend Spring's default R2DBC Dialect discovery mechanism. Implementations of this interface are discovered\nthrough Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> mechanism.",
      "translation": "SPI 将扩展 Spring 默认的 R2DBC 方言发现机制。该接口的实现将通过 Spring 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> 机制进行发现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> containing the <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> if the <a href=\"DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider</code></a> can provide a\n        dialect object, otherwise <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "包含 <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>（如果 <a href=\"DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider</code></a> 能够提供方言对象），否则为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - the connection factory to be used with the <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 用于与<a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect 中的接口\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>配合使用的连接工厂。",
      "count": 1
    },
